What: a reachable standby is missing from pg_stat_replication on the primary

Evidence:
  pg_stat_replication on db1 has no row for db2

Likely cause:
  1. WAL receiver not running (see WAL_RECEIVER_MISSING)
  2. replication slot removed
  3. standby re-pointed to another primary

Fix:
  poolwarden errors --source replication --host db2
  poolwarden attach 1

Reference: postgresql: pg_stat_replication
